        "notes": "[Restortify](item_e5073fbb-8287-4d11-934a-1fc1c57a308b) rocks, nuff said.\n\n[Efi\u2019s Theorem](item_609c4cb6-a232-4e08-a11f-5252d40382be) makes [Hooves of Steel](item_ee26ce74-568d-47ed-8dcf-fb5cc0fbac9d) & [Restortify] bonkers for survivability, turning us into a truly monstrous frontline bully. \n\nIf enemy projectiles (Junk, Zen, etc) are posing more a problem than our being in the fight for longer can account for, we take  [Spynstem Update](item_9fbbe756-5dd6-44f6-abd8-a8355f0be2b5) now and   [Restortify](item_e5073fbb-8287-4d11-934a-1fc1c57a308b) later.\n\nIf we can't afford  [Efi\u2019s Theorem](item_609c4cb6-a232-4e08-a11f-5252d40382be), take [Solar Regenergy](item_b03b2c68-d3e3-413a-a9b8-3385149ba9b8) and [Charged Chassis](item_b2307dff-5e70-4c77-bae2-2b0c2883c5bb) for now.",
